{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"state","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"state"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"state","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack(py)state"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@MLNOfflinePackState","text":"MLNOfflinePackState"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"state"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The state of an inactive or completed pack is computed lazily and is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. To request the pack’s status, use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-requestProgress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method. To get notified when the state becomes known and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it changes, observe KVO change notifications on this pack’s "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path. Alternatively, you can add an observer for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLN